   <title><![CDATA[181. Kuyperian Politics pt.5: Church and State [Leadership Now Podcast]]]></title>
   <link/>
   <description><![CDATA[<p>Tune into this week's episode as Dr. Aaron Rock wraps up his series on Kuyperian Politics. He discusses the relationship between the Church and the State and how they should work together according to God's word. He also addresses the age-old question of how Christians can vote wisely. All of that and more on this episode of Leadership Now with Dr. Aaron Rock.</p>
